S = {'cc': 'BR', 'fam': 'Corporate', 'doc': '# Brazil 2025: IRPJ and CSLL on lucro real (1200)\n\nSources: Lei 9.249/1995 (Planalto, archived 2025-07-02) and Lei 7.689/1988 (archived 2025-06-25), `br/law/`.\n* **Lei 9.249 art. 3**: "A alíquota do imposto de renda das pessoas jurídicas é de quinze por cento"; § 1° the profit\n  "que exceder a R$ 240.000,00 … sujeita-se à incidência de adicional de" ten per cent: 15 % + 10 % above R$ 240.000.\n* **Lei 7.689 art. 3 III**: CSLL "9% (nove por cento), no caso das demais pessoas jurídicas".\n* **Lei 9.249 art. 10**: dividends paid out of profits from 1996 are not subject to withholding (0 %).\n\n**Pass 7 (2026-11-21), withholding on payments abroad:** IRRF on remittances abroad: interest 15 % (Lei 9.249 art. 28, the DL 5.844 art. 100 rate); royalties and technical services 15 % (MP 2.159-70 art. 3, with CIDE); other services 25 % (Lei 9.779 art. 7); 25 % for low-tax jurisdictions (Lei 9.779 art. 8). Dividends: Lei 9.249 art. 10 exempt in 2025 (Lei 15.270 of 26 Nov 2025 adds 10 % from 2026). Grade A.', 'cit': {'name': 'IRPJ', 'sched': 'Schedule.ofList [(0, 1500), (240000, 2500)]', 'rate': 0, 'statute': 'Lei 9.249/1995 art. 3 (15 % + 10 % adicional above R$ 240.000)'}, 'wht': [{'kind': 'dividend', 'rate': 0, 'statute': 'Lei 9.249/1995 art. 10 (wording in force in 2025; the 10 % of § 4 inserted by Lei 15.270/2025 applies from 1 Jan 2026, its art. 8)'}, {'kind': 'interest', 'rate': 1500, 'statute': 'Lei 9.249/1995 art. 28 (DL 5.844/1943 art. 100): 15 %'}, {'kind': 'royalty', 'rate': 1500, 'statute': 'MP 2.159-70/2001 art. 3: royalties 15 %'}, {'kind': 'services', 'rate': 2500, 'statute': 'Lei 9.779/1999 art. 7 (Lei 13.315/2016): services 25 %'}], 'cit_extra': 'fun g => [charge .cit "CSLL" g.company.profit pos (fun b => divR .down (900 * b) BP) (statute := "Lei 7.689/1988 art. 3 III (9 %)")]', 'unsupported': [['g.entity == .company', 'losses brought forward, interest limitation and participation exemptions not modelled: taxable profit = profit + add-backs − exempt income'], ['g.entity == .company && strField g.raw "regime" != ""', '1200 cit: the elected regime named in the entity ("regime") is not modelled (grade C for that regime): the model computes the general regime only'], ['g.entity == .company && !g.company.paymentsAbroad.isEmpty', 'technical services at 15 % (MP 2.159-70 art. 3), the 25 % for low-tax jurisdictions (Lei 9.779 art. 8) and CIDE (Lei 10.168, 10 %) not modelled: services at the general 25 %']], 'guards': ['regime.citTax { profit := 1000000 } == 36000 + 190000', 'wht.amount { kind := .dividend, amount := 1000000 } == 0', 'wht.amount { kind := .interest, amount := 1000000 } == 150000', 'wht.amount { kind := .royalty, amount := 1000000 } == 150000', 'wht.amount { kind := .services, amount := 1000000 } == 250000'], 'taxes': [{'oecd': '1200', 'tax': 'IRPJ', 'statute': 'Lei 9.249/1995 art. 3', 'dated': 'Planalto archived 2025-07-02', 'grade': 'A', 'package': 'P2', 'kernel_parts': ['CorpRegime'], 'unsupported': ['presumed-profit and Simples regimes']}, {'oecd': '1200', 'tax': 'CSLL', 'statute': 'Lei 7.689/1988 art. 3', 'dated': 'Planalto archived 2025-06-25', 'grade': 'A', 'package': 'P2', 'kernel_parts': ['charge'], 'unsupported': []}, {'oecd': '1200', 'tax': 'Withholding on payments to non-residents', 'statute': 'Lei 9.249/1995 arts. 10, 28; MP 2.159-70/2001 art. 3; Lei 9.779/1999 arts. 7, 8', 'dated': 'planalto.gov.br texts read 2026-11-21 (the build server cannot reach planalto: not archived); pass 7, 2026-11-21', 'grade': 'A', 'package': 'P2', 'kernel_parts': ['Wht'], 'unsupported': ['technical services at 15 % (MP 2.159-70 art. 3), the 25 % for low-tax jurisdictions (Lei 9.779 art. 8) and CIDE (Lei 10.168, 10 %) not modelled: services at the general 25 %']}]}
